## Applicability

`alwaysApply: true` — this rule is read on every session. It supersedes any
conflicting guidance in older `.cursor/rules/*` where the older text has
not yet been updated. If a rule elsewhere in this repo tells you to do
something this rule forbids, follow this rule and file the discrepancy in
`gray_flow_lessons.md`.
